   "name": "sp_choose_utterance",
   "batch": false,
   "comment": "THE HEADLINE (extends af_choose_action into speech): chosen_speech_code = the value Argmax over the GLOBAL SpeechOption menu, which INCLUDES stay_silent. value = occasion x relationship(Bond affect/tie) x norm(pending FPP) x goal x affect_gain - face_cost - civil_inattention, over a per-agent loquacity_threshold. NO clock/schedule term -> emergent. KIND is DERIVED (adjacency-first via the norm term routing to the matching option, else the Bond's relational affect: resentment->barb, affection->warm greeting, fear->hedged, salient-event+high-tie->share, neutral->smalltalk). The coupling gains are the FALSIFIER: zeroed -> talk_value collapses to base-face -> the same fixed kind regardless of Bond = the OLD forced schedule. Composes existing Terms only; ZERO Rust.",
